#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-rc.rst:5 e8b8f38c11644b288dafa0e7bca1fd30
msgid "Crossfire and ELRS RC Systems"
msgstr "Crossfire 与 ELRS RC 系统"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-rc.rst:7 e5bae4169aa44a44be5edf0c9cadf6d6
msgid "Any Crossfire/ELRS compatible receiver can be used with ArduPilot."
msgstr "任何兼容 Crossfire/ELRS 的接收机均可与 ArduPilot 配合使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-rc.rst:9 34e623b3cbe34e9cb6a87aa87cfaf115
msgid ""
"ELRS (ExpressLRS) RC systems use the CRSF protocol and are connected in a "
"similar manner as Crossfire receivers to an autopilot UART. ELRS can also be"
" configured to be MAVLink protocol with embedded RC control (See below). On"
"  F4/F7 based autopilots the UART MUST be DMA enabled for reliable operation"
" in CRSF protocol mode. Consult :ref:`common-autopilots`."
msgstr ""
"ELRS（ExpressLRS）RC 系统使用 CRSF 协议，连接方式与 Crossfire 接收机类似，通过飞控 UART 连接。ELRS "
"也可配置为带有嵌入式 RC 控制的 MAVLink 协议（见下文）。在基于 F4/F7 的飞控上，UART 必须启用 DMA 才能在 CRSF "
"协议模式下可靠工作。请参阅 :ref:`common-autopilots`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-rc.rst:11 14e396ed115449279c4e5994458b4ad3
msgid ""
"If you do not wish to use telemetry then a TBS Crossfire or ELRS receiver "
"can be connected to the **RCIN** port using :ref:`SBUS <common-rc-systems>`."
" You must configure the receiver to output SBUS, of course."
msgstr ""
"如果您不希望使用数传，可以使用 :ref:`SBUS <common-rc-systems>` 将 TBS Crossfire 或 ELRS "
"接收机连接到 **RCIN** 端口。当然，您必须将接收机配置为输出 SBUS。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-rc.rst:15 eb49bc7cf29847ec829d389df3646cca
msgid "CRSF Receivers"
msgstr "CRSF 接收机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-rc.rst:17 aaa6c0b0db484ead9b20119072a070b4
msgid ""
"If you wish to use telemetry then a receiver can be connected to a UART "
"utilizing the `CRSF <https://www.team-"
"blacksheep.com/products/prod:crossfire_tx>`__ protocol."
msgstr ""
"如果您希望使用数传，可以通过 `CRSF <https://www.team-"
"blacksheep.com/products/prod:crossfire_tx>`__ 协议将接收机连接到 UART。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-rc.rst:19 339a411147224f949614816b77534904
msgid ""
"CRSF is a full-duplex protocol that supports integrated telemetry and a "
"number of other features. Connect the RX pin of the UART to the CRSF TX pin "
"of the CRSF device and vice versa. Currently a full-duplex UART connection "
"is required. For best performance a UART with DMA capability on its RX port "
"is desirable, but not required. A message will be displayed once on the GCS "
"console, if connected to a UART without this capability on an F4/F7 based "
"autopilot."
msgstr ""
"CRSF 是支持集成数传和多种其他功能的全双工协议。将 UART 的 RX 引脚连接到 CRSF 设备的 CRSF TX 引脚，反之亦然。目前需要全双工"
" UART 连接。为获得最佳性能，建议（但不强制要求）选用 RX 端口具有 DMA 能力的 UART。如果连接到不具备此能力的 UART（基于 "
"F4/F7 的飞控），地面站控制台将显示一条提示信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-rc.rst:22 e75fe411a58a47e48e83ada2e5c05afc
msgid ""
"In the configuration of the serial port select the RCIN protocol. So for "
"example for serial port 4:"
msgstr "在串口配置中选择 RCIN 协议。例如，对于串口 4："

