msgid "Set :ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL <SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` = 23"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL <SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` = 23"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-rc.rst:25 1d52a303c7074edc90a759ac40767779
msgid "Set :ref:`RSSI_TYPE <RSSI_TYPE>` = 3"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`RSSI_TYPE <RSSI_TYPE>` = 3"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-rc.rst:27 0fad18c92b3d4ebe9663d3c3225dd0df
msgid ""
"The serial port baudrate is automatically set and controlled by the firmware"
" when any serial RC protocol, such as CRSF, is detected."
msgstr "当检测到任何串口 RC 协议（如 CRSF）时，固件会自动设置并控制串口波特率。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-rc.rst:29 4ee9b4c194a4473f874a0e962f8793d6
msgid ""
"With the receiver connected and configured correctly proceed with RC "
"calibration as normal."
msgstr "接收机连接并正确配置后，按照正常流程进行 RC 校准。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-rc.rst:31 7bf36878bc3b40de9bde54bfacc31b88
msgid ""
"See :ref:`common-crsf-telemetry` for information about telemetry data sent, "
"display scripts for OpenTX transmitters, and adjustment of ArduPilot "
"parameters via CRSF."
msgstr ""
"有关已发送数传数据、OpenTX 遥控器显示脚本以及通过 CRSF 调整 ArduPilot 参数的信息，请参阅 :ref:`common-crsf-"
"telemetry`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-rc.rst:33 838989d6c7814da6b2b285df53bf27a9
msgid ""
"If the autopilot is rebooted via MAVLink, it will lose communication with "
"the CRSF receiver until the receiver is power cycled. Also, the CRSF TX must"
" be transmitting BEFORE the receiver is powered up."
msgstr ""
"如果飞控通过 MAVLink 重启，它将与 CRSF 接收机失去通信，直到接收机重新上电。此外，CRSF TX 必须在接收机上电之前开始发射。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-rc.rst:36 f9e5ecffb3094afcabdfbbadd1271a11
msgid "ELRS Receivers"
msgstr "ELRS 接收机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-rc.rst:38 360a947d56634a17916f1042a6c24c92
msgid ""
"ELRS can be setup in the same manner as CRSF above , however, bit 13 of "
":ref:`RC_OPTIONS<RC_OPTIONS>` should be set to alter the baudrate from "
"416KBaud that CRSF uses, to 420KBaud that ELRS uses. As mentioned above, the"
" UART selected must have DMA capability. ELRS can also be configured to "
"output MAVLink, enabling full bidirectional Mavlink telemetry and RC control"
" over the same link. See :ref:`ELRS <common-rc-systems>` for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"ELRS 可以与上述 CRSF 相同的方式设置，但应将 :ref:`RC_OPTIONS<RC_OPTIONS>` 的第 13 位设置为 1，将波特率从"
" CRSF 使用的 416KBaud 更改为 ELRS 使用的 420KBaud。如上所述，所选 UART 必须具有 DMA 能力。ELRS "
"也可配置为输出 MAVLink，从而通过同一链路实现完整的双向 MAVLink 数传和 RC 控制。更多信息请参阅 :ref:`ELRS "
"<common-rc-systems>`。"

