#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-rc.rst:63 07dfa126339f4f11b0317862cf5a328b
msgid "ELRS bootloader \"lockup\""
msgstr "ELRS 引导程序「锁死」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-rc.rst:65 96614f7f5672405fa082f30b8b24fa26
msgid ""
"Some ELRS receivers can appear to be locked up in \"bootloader\" mode when "
"the autopilot system is powered on. This is usually due to the UART RX pin "
"to which they are attached being held low during power application, which "
"ELRS interprets as being forced into bootloader mode."
msgstr ""
"某些 ELRS 接收机在飞控系统上电时可能出现锁死在「引导程序」模式的情况。这通常是因为接收机所连接的 UART RX 引脚在上电期间被拉低，ELRS "
"将此解读为被强制进入引导程序模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-rc.rst:67 6b0e0080be5b4f02983d46491dba7c8b
msgid ""
"The most common cause for this is when the autopilot board also has a DJI HD"
" VTX attached and the SBUS pin of that interface is directly tied to the "
"UART RX pin being used for RC input from the ELRS. If the VTX is not powered"
" up at the same time as the ELRS, the SBUS output will act as a current sink"
" for the ELRS TX pin and force it into bootloader. This occurs if the "
"autopilot is only being powered from USB or the autopilot bootloader forces "
"the HD VTX power supply off on boot(so that the pilot must toggle a "
"transmitter switch to actively turn it on, for power/heat saving). The "
"simple solution is to remove the SBUS wire going from the HD VTX to the DJI "
"connector."
msgstr ""
"最常见的原因是飞控板同时连接了 DJI HD VTX，而该接口的 SBUS 引脚直接接到了用于 ELRS RC 输入的 UART RX 引脚。如果 "
"VTX 上电时间与 ELRS 不同步，SBUS 输出会作为 ELRS TX 引脚的电流汇并将其强制进入引导程序模式。这种情况发生在仅通过 USB "
"为飞控供电，或飞控引导程序在启动时强制关闭 HD VTX 电源（以便飞手通过遥控开关主动开启以节省功耗/散热）时。简单的解决方法是拔掉从 HD VTX "
"到 DJI 接口的 SBUS 连线。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-rc.rst:70 6b9971fa00784916967a2f869d82016a
msgid "CRSF Video Transmitters"
msgstr "CRSF 视频发射机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-rc.rst:72 81de7a2d24b4477696a7149d48387a6b
msgid ""
"TBS Video Transmitters can also be connected to ArduPilot using the CRSF "
"protocol. This allows the VTX to be configured via parameters and, for VTXs "
"such as the `TBS Unify Evo <https://www.team-"
"blacksheep.com/products/prod:tbs_unify_evo>`__ , receive telemetry data that"
" can be displayed using the built-in OSD."
msgstr ""
"TBS 视频发射机也可以通过 CRSF 协议连接到 ArduPilot。这样可以通过参数配置 VTX，对于 `TBS Unify Evo "
"<https://www.team-blacksheep.com/products/prod:tbs_unify_evo>`__ 等 "
"VTX，还可以接收并通过内置 OSD 显示数传数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-rc.rst:74 43906c29b85749cdb58ef085bd741a9b
